Sprint 3: Scope & Initial Prototype Note

This folder contains a lightweight initial prototype created to verify tool compatibility and test our basic ML pipeline. It is an early proof-of-concept and not the final implementation.

1. Ready-to-Use Libraries & Datasets:
   • Basic Libraries: scikit-learn, SHAP, pandas, numpy, and nfstream.
   • Datasets: Downloaded CIC-IoT2023 and IoT-23 datasets.

2. Custom Work (To be developed for the project):
   • Building per-device behavioral baselines.
   • Data cleaning and feature mapping for IoT traffic.
   • Developing the 0–100 risk score formula.
   • Formatting SHAP explanations into user-friendly alerts.

3. Current Prototype Status:
   • The current Colab notebook is a simple test run using sample data to make sure the libraries work together.
   • The actual training on real IoT datasets and model tuning will take place in the upcoming milestones.
